"Eight characters: the corners, the horizontal, the vertical and the two\n"
"junctions of a separator — “┌─┐│└┘├┤”, or “+-+|+++” in plain ASCII."
msgstr ""
"Ocho caracteres: las esquinas, la horizontal, la vertical y las dos\n"
"uniones de un separador — «┌─┐│└┘├┤», o «+-+|+++» en ASCII simple."

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:221
